# PR metadata

After `gh pr create`:

1. Assignee: `developerGitHub` from `.cursor/project.config.json`
2. Reviewers: `pr.defaultReviewers` array
3. Confirm: `gh pr view <n> --json assignees,reviewRequests,url`

Draft Slack/Teams review ping in chat; post only when user asks.
